                "text": "On the floor of the House, we observed a moment of silence in memory of Evan Anzoo, the first child to die at the hands of #DonaldTrump and #ElonMusk.\n\nTwo of the richest men in the world cut off food and medicine for the poorest people in the world.\n\nFive-year-old Evan died in February when #USAID was gutted and Evan was cut off from his HIV medication.\n\nSee my remarks below \u2b07\ufe0f",
