                "text": "Next time you hear Republicans claim they\u2019re \"protecting\" health care, remember: they voted for Trump\u2019s #BigUglyBill that defunds #PlannedParenthood, ripping away reproductive care and access to critical non-abortion services \u2014 from cancer screenings to basic checkups \u2014 from millions of Americans.\n\nAmericans deserve better. Californians deserve better. I will continue to fight for the right of all people to access the care they need and deserve, no matter what.",
